6
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:19,700
Tell her to come to my office.

7
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,260
Mr. Ling, you wanted to see me?

8
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:28,820
You did well in court.

9
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,420
These are rewards for you.

10
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:32,900
Pick one.

11
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,400
Mr. Ling, these are too valuable.

12
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,530
I can't accept them.

13
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,060
What's wrong?

14
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,060
Don't you like it?

15
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:41,900
No.

16
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:45,220
I'm really happy to have your approval.

17
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:47,200
But these gifts are too valuable.

18
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,329
I can't accept them.

19
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:50,920
If you really want to reward me,

20
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:53,460
then please give me more work.

21
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:00,420
Really?

22
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:03,820
This is the first time I've heard of such a reward.

23
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:06,420
I still have a lot to learn.

24
00:04:06,820 --> 00:04:08,260
Once I've learned enough,

25
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:10,390
I'll definitely ask you for a big gift.

26
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:12,060
Okay.

27
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:13,660
I'll wait for you.

28
00:04:14,220 --> 00:04:16,820
If there's nothing else, I'll head back first.

29
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:33,950
Why didn't you take the reward?

30
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:36,060
That wasn't a reward.

31
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:37,400
It was clearly a way to buy me off.

32
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:38,860
Of course I couldn't take it.

33
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,420
Besides.

34
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:41,500
This is the second step the book taught me.

35
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,620
First, you have to catch the prey's attention.

36
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:44,159
Then,

37
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,900
