38
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,600
I really don't understand your generation.

39
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,659
You make everything so complicated.

40
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:54,860
Because you're just an old fossil who doesn't understand anything.

41
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,659
Wh-What do you mean by an antique?

42
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,220
Sister Cheng, this is the live stream schedule.

43
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:06,280
Please take a look.

44
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:14,800
