65
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,820
This is your only option right now.

66
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:05,420
Look at the others.

67
00:06:05,420 --> 00:06:06,500
Cut the crap.

68
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,620
Do you not understand what I'm saying?

69
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:09,860
I don't accept this.

70
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:10,940
Mucheng,

71
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:14,360
