72
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:16,160
You can only follow orders.

73
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:18,560
Face reality and don't back out.

74
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:20,500
If you don't accept it, legal will handle it as a breach of contract.

75
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:21,060
You...

76
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:24,260
Who do you think you are,

77
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:26,100
