78
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,800
And who do you think you are?

79
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,880
Okay, we can start now.

80
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,659
Alright.

81
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:48,860
Hello, brothers.

82
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:50,200
I'm Mucheng.

83
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:52,100
Did you miss me?

84
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,760
Don't believe those rumors online.

85
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,820
I didn't have a falling out with the company.

86
00:06:57,820 --> 00:06:59,159
And from now on,

87
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:01,220
I will use a brand new streaming format

88
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:02,460
