89
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:02,820
Say something...

90
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:04,160
Welcome the new streamer.

91
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,600
Say something.

92
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,060
Say hello.

93
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:06,990
We will keep you company together.

94
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:37,640
[VIP Internal Group (Members: 8)]

95
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:46,300
Thank you, Mr. Wang, for the gift.

96
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:47,600
Thank you.

97
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,680
Thank you.

98
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,960
Thank you, Brother Cui.

99
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:52,400
Thank you, Unknown Artist.

100
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:55,860
Thank you, Earthly Beauty and Enthusiastic Audience.

101
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:57,260
Thank you for your company.

102
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:59,260
Thank you.

103
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:06,200
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

104
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:10,920
Two, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

105
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:14,560
Three, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

106
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,160
Baby Mucheng, you are the main character.

107
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,400
We are here to see you.

108
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,400
Say something...

109
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:22,100
