111
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:30,660
Congratulations to Mucheng for winning the premiere PK.

112
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,460
Congratulations.

113
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:33,080
Thank you.

114
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,140
Congratulations.

115
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:40,020
