121
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:05,460
Almost done.

122
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,520
Help me. Help.

123
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,700
Help me.

124
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:28,460
Let me go. Let me go.

125
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:30,500
Memories sealed for nearly a thousand years

126
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:31,360
Help me.

127
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,490
